From 66f2fc8448c8f47f94cb4bd8de5ed255dcd5c17e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: User <user@example.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 01:38:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] chore(deps): bump electron-builder to 26.15.3, clearing
 all audit findings

The 25 -> 26 major bump resolves the last 7 high-severity audit findings
(electron-updater token leak on redirect, AppImage search path, tar and
builder-util-runtime chains). npm audit now reports zero vulnerabilities
across prod and dev. Validated: npm ci from the refreshed lockfile, all
native binaries intact (better-sqlite3, lightningcss, oxide, rollup,
esbuild), typecheck, repo lint, production build, full backend (1136) and
frontend (829) suites, runtime smoke on an isolated temp DB, and an
electron-builder --dir unpacked build.
